<title>USA: PHLX lists five new equity options.</title>
<headline>PHLX lists five new equity options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said it began trading options on shares of American Exploration Co, Arnold Industries Inc, International Multifoods Corp, May &amp; Speh Inc and Youth Services International Inc on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
